  "prefLabel": "Mil 201.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mil 201.01 Purpose. This chapter provides rules of practice and procedure for the hearing of appeals by the milk sanitation board. The purpose of these rules is to allow the milk sanitation board to acquire sufficient information to reach fair and reasoned decisions.\n\nSource. #7529, eff 7-12-01",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mil100-300.html"
